# Flash PPAPI binaries — COMMITTED to repo (Flash EOL, no updates needed).
# Linux: flash/libpepflashplayer.so (Clean Flash v1.7, 34.0.0.137)
# Windows: flash/pepflashplayer.dll (Clean Flash v1.54, 34.0.0.376)
# Source: https://github.com/darktohka/clean-flash-builds
# On-demand download still works as fallback (FlashUpdater) but binaries
# are version-controlled for offline robustness.
# userData/flash-cache/ is NOT committed (user-local cache).
flash/flash-cache/

